# Porting Main App Features to ScrollBench

## Goal

Transform ScrollBench into the primary application by porting all features from the main app while maintaining ScrollBench's superior performance.

---

## Main App Features Analysis

### ✅ Already in ScrollBench
- Grid view with dynamic sizing
- Ctrl+Wheel zoom (20-400px)
- Grid size slider
- Thumbnail resolution slider
- Viewport culling
- Frame budget control
- Performance monitoring
- Folder selection
- Recursive scanning
- AsyncImageProvider integration

### 🔄 Features to Port

#### 1. PhotoViewer (Single Image Mode)
**From:** [PhotoViewer.qml](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/resources/qml/PhotoViewer.qml)
- Full-screen image/video viewer
- Swipe left/right navigation
- Zoom in/out (wheel, pinch, double-tap)
- Pan when zoomed
- Video playback with controls
- Info overlay (metadata)
- Edit mode (crop)
- Keyboard shortcuts (arrows, space, esc, +/-)

#### 2. Selection System
**New Feature** (user requested)
- Checkbox on each thumbnail
- Visible at all zoom levels
- Multi-select capability
- Select all / Deselect all
- Selection count display
- Actions on selected items

#### 3. UI Improvements
**User Requests:**
- **Filename display** instead of numbers at 90px+ zoom
- **Sliding performance overlay** from left side
- **Transparent toggle button** that doesn't interfere with selection

#### 4. Bottom Navigation Bar
**From:** [Main.qml](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/resources/qml/Main.qml) → `BottomBar.qml`
- Tab navigation (Pictures, Albums, Stories, Menu)
- For ScrollBench: simplify to Pictures + Settings tabs

#### 5. Settings Persistence
**From:** [Main.qml](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/resources/qml/Main.qml) Settings
- Last folder path
- Grid size
- Thumbnail resolution
- View preferences

#### 6. Additional Features
- Semantic zoom (date grouping) - optional
- Album view - optional
- Timeline scrubber - optional

