## Implementation Plan

### Phase 1: Core UI Restructure

#### A. Sliding Performance Overlay
**Files:** [MainScrollBench.qml](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/test_scrollbench/qml/MainScrollBench.qml), [PerformanceOverlay.qml](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/test_scrollbench/qml/PerformanceOverlay.qml)

**Changes:**
1. Move performance overlay to left side (off-screen by default)
2. Add transparent toggle button (left edge, middle)
3. Slide animation (200ms ease-in-out)
4. Overlay width: 350px
5. Button: 30x60px, 10% opacity, increases on hover

#### B. Filename Display
**Files:** [MainScrollBench.qml](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/test_scrollbench/qml/MainScrollBench.qml) delegate

**Changes:**
1. At gridSize < 90px: Show `#index`
2. At gridSize >= 90px: Show `fileName` (elided)
3. Text box below thumbnail
4. Font size scales with grid size

---

