## Implementation Order

1. **Sliding Performance Overlay** (1-2 hours)
   - Visual change, easy to test
   
2. **Filename Display** (30 min)
   - Simple conditional text change
   
3. **Selection System** (2-3 hours)
   - Model changes + UI checkboxes
   
4. **PhotoViewer Integration** (2-3 hours)
   - Copy component, adapt, wire up
   
5. **Settings Persistence** (1 hour)
   - Copy SettingsHelper, integrate
   
6. **Polish** (1-2 hours)
   - Keyboard shortcuts, context menu

**Total Estimate:** 8-12 hours of work

